{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:03 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:03 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:03 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"「爆竹」告東尼起孖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/589720c2a7c9312e26a49ac3ab93deac/2026-11/r4_0.jpg\"/><p>告東尼馬房的「爆竹」於今季復岀，上仗在谷草中距離大敗跑包尾，賽後被驗出有喘鳴症，可是個多月後，此駒今晚谷草第四場再跑同程，卻由巴度策騎一放到底勝岀，馬房起孖而回。</p><p>贏馬後，已故賭王何鴻燊的兒子即馬主何猷亨不在場，只由別人代表拉頭馬，較特別是凱旋門上，出現了告卓華（Trevor）的身影。Trevor正是告東尼胞兄告達理的兒子。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69f31ceddcceee2b821a1dd2dc0a9910/2026-11/44_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a0239effd2b145d935f2dbd4e7b0d82/2026-11/444_0.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.898460+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:03:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:47.428600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:43.370898+00:00","content_hash":"b7d967d4205fe175aea9e2e2486662e129c1d5220d17486b29da0a8c5b85be0b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}